    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Pawns function like creatures with the construct and mindless traits. By default, a pawn is a Small creature, and its body is made of 1 Bulk of the materials described in your Craft. Pawns have a Speed of 25 feet.</p><p>As constructs, pawns are immune to bleed damage, death effects, disease, nonlethal attacks, poison, vitality, void, and the doomed, drained, fatigued, paralyzed, sickened, and unconscious conditions. As mindless creatures, pawns are also immune to mental effects and mental damage.</p>"
